        {
          "id": 3496958942,
          "type": "DiffNote",
          "body": "I have some memories of that being an option on 32 bit Windows a long time ago, bur could be mistaken. It might have been the case on some obsolete version of MSVC but I can't find any documentation at the moment, other than some noting that it has been 64 bit even on 32 bit Windows since VS 2005.",
